Description: fail PEAP MSCHAPv2 closed on digest errors
 Load the OpenSSL 3 legacy provider before fetching MD4, check every
 provider and EVP operation, and propagate failures to the PEAP response
 composer. Include RFC 2759 vectors and injected provider/fetch/digest
 failures.
Author: Ashutosh Agrawal <ashu@cisco.com>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-09-26

